        "raw": "<p>Last night, a friend of mine reminded me that we haven&#39;t played the Shadowrun RPG since November of 2011. &nbsp;That time lapse is why I hadn&#39;t heard about Crossfire until this week, even though it came out earlier this year and has been getting press since 2013. &nbsp;Hearing about the game this week is what prompted the conversation about Shadowrun at all.</p><p>I really like deck-builders. &nbsp;I really like co-op games. &nbsp;I really like the Shadowrun universe. &nbsp;I am perfectly fine with the expectation that a 25% win rate starting out is good. &nbsp;Having read a bunch of reviews and discussions about the game, and watched a couple videos of gameplay, I&#39;m extremely interested in trying it out...and maybe even buying two copies to see how well it&#39;d work with more than four players on a team.</p><p>So, I&#39;m curious - anyone on these forums have any experience with this game?</p>",
