        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-06T16:42:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah. Played it once. I'll never play it again.</p><p>I'm sure I'm an anomoly, but I definitely didn't enjoy it. I didn't feel like I had any interesting choices. I honestly felt like I was just going through the motions of the obvious things I had to do / deal with. We honestly didn't have a good experience, getting things that just slaughtered us.</p><p>It was a couple months ago and I have tried not to think about it much, since, so I don't have any details (sorry). Hopefully other folks enjoyed it, though... ?</p>",
