        "raw": "<p>Yeah. Played it once. I&#39;ll never play it again.</p><p>I&#39;m sure I&#39;m an anomoly, but I definitely didn&#39;t enjoy it. I didn&#39;t feel like I had any interesting choices. I honestly felt like I was just going through the motions of the obvious things I had to do / deal with. We honestly didn&#39;t have a good experience, getting things that just slaughtered us.</p><p>It was a couple months ago and I have tried not to think about it much, since, so I don&#39;t have any details (sorry). Hopefully other folks enjoyed it, though... ?</p>",
